message: "If you use this software, data or results, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Simulators That Forgive Losses Teach Reinforcement-Learning Traders to Gamble: Theory, Detection and Removal, with an Application to Electricity Trading"
authors:
  - alias: gepapak
version: "7.0.0"
date-released: "2026-11-19"
repository-code: "https://github.com/gepapak/accounting-options-rl"
license:
